  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Power is a power-oriented co-polyester monofilament developed for players who want more ball speed without sacrificing the spin and durability of the RPM family. Its unique extrusion process and special surface coating create a crisp impact feel and distinctive sound, while maintaining excellent spin and long-term durability. It is best suited to advanced players with fast swings who attack from the baseline.",
    "zh": "Babolat RPM Power 是 RPM 系列中强调力量输出的高密度共聚酯单丝球线。独特的挤压工艺结合特殊表面涂层，使它在保持 RPM 系列高旋转和耐久性的同时，提供更强的击球速度、更清脆的击球反馈以及独特的击球声音。非常适合挥拍速度快、依靠底线进攻和重炮击球的高级及比赛型球员。"
  },

